Checking the health of your cluster before upgrading IBM Software Hub (Upgrading from Version 5.1 to Version 5.3)
Last Updated: 2026-08-20

The IBM Software Hub command-line interface includes commands that you can use the validate the health of your cluster before you upgrade IBM Software Hub.

Upgrade phase

